WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.970
Dvin, on the plain of Ayrarat,

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:08.495
was the seat of the catholicos,
head of the Armenian Church.

3
00:00:08.735 --> 00:00:13.330
In 640 the first Arab armies
came north into Armenia.

4
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.740
Theodoros Rshtuni
took the field against them,

5
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.420
but the raiders reached Dvin
and took it,

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.540
despite a stubborn defense.

7
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.030
It was a raid, not yet a conquest,

8
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.870
and Dvin rose again.

9
00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.478
Man the walls.

